xcxp2xjtV4ZrKhjcrZCl88f0ThWh4zmg&oe=6A8D8218"}]}, "id": "2713860495679965", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171729.png", "id": "1244881073644028", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619704_1244881076977361_5615678092938328795_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gnztypgXnMoQ7kNvwEd7q3v&_nc_oc=AdoBAaDCdkstg9sXKFpjNWJabRSWoUHRhuXvtv8ZWn0E7rM9Wiq387xQvSIsDnh2i4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFzqvNdTBMqPlxoRb8o6McmaN5Ab3v1Rj5A3KtDvjcwPg&oe=6A8D8DBA"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171803.png", "id": "878545175052858", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_878545181719524_1967766508375899942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7xJOd2xr95YQ7kNvwFYZKtn&_nc_oc=AdpOmri74gGquGSa9Xq7Ym66-5ZwgzRJcqInzUSMuhRxjYUkhc67-Ub4zsBZgPNfk7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFJ_KS4S5iIgYKskAaPrCf6aCYql2oveVryTufzMQ_gYQ&oe=6A8D6B1D"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171753.png", "id": "2355644911606270", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_2355644914939603_7881252502421777745_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a8u9nPnRfnAQ7kNvwGXxrP4&_nc_oc=Adrv-_OP6uO3o-_ZpasCE1RUVDYTle9aC5eIMrVRPQbk82uMDtkTqafOcYxObHcTRBs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGOPH5bXKCSfjKStKzv-kr1cesh0tu4paqrV9JI9GTZKg&oe=6A8D79D2"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171744.png", "id": "1574678113766454", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308961_1574678117099787_7551936325078272668_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o2uJ_BUjcX4Q7kNvwHH-pkV&_nc_oc=Adpz8VXHF6keUoDYN7qJFounjPB7U9fVGXM5PZJb2WiFKm2qR4-bloPpkHqL4rqpdk0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH2fARxtRi1Bjv9aJWqlPjyM0o6sdZYkgAH365T3RQs1g&oe=6A8D8CE9"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260222-171747.png", "id": "936482305505709", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_936482308839042_2870889141134525125_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BNhrYP89qwMQ7kNvwH97lPj&_nc_oc=AdqYmvURXQP_192-SomcKu82n0avDK17FZNiUZbA6YrRnKBtmT6ZPkdB5GZo8mLO4os&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFlCiacy0YYmJd0Sols9t8oeFeCw-a6c9w22YKJleAxaw&oe=6A8D9D1F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape.png", "id": "1595686508155082", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_1595686511488415_510087455054191114_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GyFVw60JQscQ7kNvwHdrmwi&_nc_oc=Adq158HF-tGi9Y4bOQmr5S6N1MxwTrVkXkudYhUqx1Kl99UQRXcVRnBdv28C749E85A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHOm0UMdY20htLr7sTpEHoTCOM5fHBPEKHr15CKPqOETA&oe=6A8D6A96"}, "display_name": "Boxing Drills VR", "keywords": ["boxing", "padwork", "trainer", "drills", "speed"], "long_description": "# Train Like a Real Boxer\n\nBoxing Drills VR brings authentic pad training to your Quest. No gym required.\n\n**Realistic Drills**\n\nFollow a virtual trainer through classic boxing combinations:\n- **1-2 (Jab-Cross)** - The fundamental combo\n- **1-2-Duck** - Add defensive movement\n- **1-2-3** - Jab, Cross, Hook\n- **1-2-3-2** - Extended combinations\n- **Uppercut combos** - Work those body shots\n- **Growing Library** - A vast selection of drills with new content added regularly!\n\n**Built for Performance**\n\nWe know every millisecond counts when you're in the pocket.\n- Low-Latency Precision: Built from the ground up for high-performance tracking.\n- Native Feel: Optimized to ensure smooth, responsive feedback that feels like hitting real pads.\n\n**Get Scored**\n\nEvery session tracks your performance:\n- **Power** - Hit those pads hard\n- **Speed** - Quick reactions matter\n- **Agility** - Duck and weave like a pro\n- **Form** - Return to guard after every punch\n\n**Train Your Way**\n- Multiple drill durations (30s to 3 min)\n- Choose the speed that suits you (slow, medium, fast, progressive, variable)\n- Passthrough mode - train safely in your own space\n\n**Perfect For**\n- Beginners learning boxing basics\n- Fitness enthusiasts wanting a fun workout\n- Experienced boxers staying sharp\n\nNo experience needed. Just clear some space, put on your Quest, and start throwing punches.\n\n**Shape the Future (Open Source)**\n\nWe believe the best training tools are built by the community. We are moving toward an open-source model so the community can help us shape the roadmap of the product.", "short_description": "Train like a boxer in VR. Follow realistic pad drills with jabs, crosses, hooks, and uppercuts. Practice defense with duck-and-weave combos. Track your power, speed, and form after every session."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://boxing-drills-ec8acc.gitlab.io/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://boxing-drills-ec8acc.gitlab.io/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Wobble Bot Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://boxing-drills-ec8acc.gitlab.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26010917265210852"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1013623321669324"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1005552205303411"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1657151418799256"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "899033179613105"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4443476652641359"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "899033179613105"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790096400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1013623321669324"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28263218403314049", "version": "0.34.14"}, "id": "790503750728261", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28263218403314049"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787276995, "id": "28264184919884064", "version": "0.34.15", "version_code": 16779219, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28263218403314049"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.14\n\n**Switch stance mid-drill**\n- New STANCE control on the main menu, next to RANGE: Orthodox, Southpaw, or Auto.\n- On Auto, drills switch your lead at random between combos. The coach calls the new stance, a big banner shows it, and the pads wait a beat so you can move your feet. Set how often it happens in Settings.\n\n**Defense cues are easier to read**\n- The first time each type of threat appears in a drill (duck, roll, slip, weave, pull), it holds still for a moment with a double tap sound so you can read it before it flies. After that they come at full speed.\n- Fixed: on the faster speeds, a duck or roll that clipped you late in its flight sometimes went unscored. Every clip counts now.\n\n**Find your starting spot**\n- A ring and arrow on the floor show where to stand and which way to face while the countdown runs. It fades out after GO.\n- The tutorial's stance page uses the same ring: start with your lead foot in the circle.\n", "created_date": 1787269768, "id": "28263218403314049", "version": "0.34.14", "version_code": 16779217, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28263218403314049"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1787109136, "id": "28240540595581830", "version": "0.34.13", "version_code": 16779215, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28263218403314049"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.12\n\n**Straight body shots**\n- Two new punches: the body jab (1B) and the body cross (2B). The pad drops to belly height and tilts the way a trainer holds it for straights downstairs. Bend your knees to get level with it, the level change is what scores.\n- Five new drills to train them: 1B-2B, 1-2B, 1B-2, LEVEL CHANGE (all four 1-2 height mixes in one sequence, so you have to read the pads instead of autopiloting) and SLIP & DIG (slip outside the jab, then dig the cross to the body from the angle).\n- Pad numbers and combo callouts show 1B and 2B so you always know which floor a punch goes to. Body straights count toward your body punch records in Career.\n\n**Combo Caller**\n- There is now a proper stop between calls. The pads pull back, the next combo appears, you get a couple of seconds to read it, then the pads come out. Before this the ten calls ran together as one continuous drill.\n- The new body straight combos are in the calling pool.", "created_date": 1787010112, "id": "28226799523622604", "version": "0.34.12", "version_code": 16779213, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26010917241877521", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28263218403314049"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "790503750728261"}]}, "change_log": "### v0.34.11\n\n**Workouts run their full length**\n- Drills that finish early, like COMBO CALLER completing its set, were quietly counting as their full scheduled length and cutting workouts short. A five minute workout now gives you five minutes of work.\n\n**Pause moved to Y**\n- Pause is now on the Y button. X sat right where a clenched fist could clip it mid-combo, so it does something harmless instead: it adds the highlighted drill to your workout list. The menu button still pauses too. ", "created_date": 1786503402, "id": "28152557444380146", "version": "0.34.11", "version_code": 16779211, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}